The variation with potential difference $V$ of the current $I$ in a semiconductor diode is shown in Fig. 6.1.

{{figure:figure_6_1.png}}

Use Fig. 6.1 to describe qualitatively the variation of the resistance of the diode as $V$ increases from 0 to $1.0\text{ V}$.

