The diode in (b) is part of the circuit shown in Fig. 6.2.

{{figure:figure_6_2.png}}

The cell of electromotive force (e.m.f.) $2.0\text{ V}$ and negligible internal resistance is connected in series with the diode and resistors X and Y. The resistance of Y is $60\,\Omega$. The current in the cell is $15\text{ mA}$.
